{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118342","id":3508349744,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7RHSsw","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118342","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118342.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118342.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118342","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118342/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118342/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118342/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3f8691768fbf8859cd7b12272565781056fb47a9","number":118342,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add OffsetOrigin enum for animated sprite pivot","user":{"login":"RainCmd","id":49861707,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODYxNzA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49861707?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd","html_url":"https://github.com/RainCmd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RainCmd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Changes\r\nThis PR extends the offset pivot system of AnimatedSprite2D from only 2 positions (TopLeft, Center) to **full 9 anchor positions**:\r\n\r\n- TopLeft\r\n- TopCenter\r\n- TopRight\r\n- CenterLeft\r\n- Center\r\n- CenterRight\r\n- BottomLeft\r\n- BottomCenter\r\n- BottomRight\r\n\r\nAdded a new enum `OffsetOrigin` to control the offset starting point.\r\nAll positions are properly registered to ClassDB and exposed to scripting.\r\n\r\n## Reason\r\nPreviously, users could only offset from the top-left corner or center, which limited advanced positioning and animation layout workflows.\r\nWith 9-point origin support, users can now offset from any standard anchor point for more flexible sprite placement.\r\n\r\n## Test\r\nCompiled successfully.\r\nAll enum values work correctly in both code and editor inspector.\r\nOffset calculation behaves as expected.\r\n<img width=\"787\" height=\"465\" alt=\"Snipaste_2026-04-09_19-40-18\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fbc6f815-8599-4dbd-ab30-4be94172132c\" />\r\n<img width=\"715\" height=\"294\" alt=\"Snipaste_2026-04-09_19-40-48\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d70b4734-2f20-4621-95e1-b905e84019de\" />\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creat